# Topic branches on omarchy-asus/omarchy, each kept rebased on omacom/omarchy quattro
# by ./rebase-topics.
#
# <branch> <kind> <draft or pull request>
#   kind: pr    = written to be opened on omacom/omarchy as it is; draft under prs/
#         open  = head of an open pull request on omacom/omarchy (a squashed copy of a
#                 topic branch); rebasing it updates that pull request
#         carry = someone else's open upstream pull request, carried until it merges
#         fork  = stays in the fork (model-specific policy, or upstream said no)
#
# A branch whose commits upstream already has is reported by ./rebase-topics; remove it here.
# Package and kernel changes live in omarchy-asus/omarchy-pkgs (drafts as prs/pkgs-*.md).
# The shipped G16 fixes are patch files in omarchy-asus/omarchy-asus, built on stock
# omarchy releases (fork branch asus/v4-0-5 holds that backport; it is not listed here).

# Power and adapters (ASUS)
asus/asusd-power-profiles         pr    asusd-power-profiles.md
